45ZM. Monetary Policy Report.
(1) The Bank shall, once in every six months, publish a document to be called
the Monetary Policy Report, explaining—
(a) the sources of inflation; and
(b) the forecasts of inflation for the period between six to eighteen months
from the date of publication of the document.
